\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid8334701 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Assume loose cash will eventually get mugged.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Storage options:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Bank \hich\f44 \emdash \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  strong medium/long-term storage once interest matters.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Faction vault \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  convenient if allowed; requires trust.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Company vault \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  useful if available; requires trust/access.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Items/stocks/points \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  protects from direct mugging but adds price risk.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Ghost trades \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  useful short-term; watch expiration.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Trusted traders \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  useful for plushies, flowers, points, and items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  PI vault \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  later utility, not a beginner purchase reason by itself.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807 
