\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid8334701 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Common selling methods:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Trusted trader \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  simple for plushies, flowers, points, and common travel goods. Check reputation first.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Bazaar \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  useful once you can afford the points unlock; avoids the item-market sales fee, but buyers can still mug you after buying.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Item Market \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  convenient and instant, but has market fees and can expose sale timing.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Trade \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  good for direct deals, bulk sales, or faction/community sales. Confirm every item and price before accepting.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Ghost trade \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  useful short-term cash protection, but expired/c\hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 ancelled trades return money to you and can make it muggable again.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 
