\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Store proceeds immediately after selling.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Do not advertise that you just sold a large pile of goods.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Be cautious with private messages offering unusually good prices.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Check item names carefully before buying drugs, boosters, weapons, armor, or rare items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  When selling to a trader, confirm whether they pay by trade, mug-safe timing, faction vault, or another method.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807 
