\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Energy refill \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  30 points, once per day. Usually one of the best early progression uses once training seriously.

\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Nerve refill \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  30 points, useful later for crime-focused accounts, but usually lower priority than energy for beginners.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Racing License \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  unlocks racing; useful when you are ready to start racing discipline.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Stock Ticker \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  unlocks stock buying and selling.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Bazaar \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  unlocks your personal bazaar for selling items without the item-market sales fee.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Merits \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  expensive; usually avoid buyin\hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 g early unless you know the plan.
