\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 1. Keep enough liquidity for Castle or PI rent, travel stock, meds, and education/training basics.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 2. Use energy refills when the cost makes sense and you can train immediately.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 3. Buy Racing License only when you intend to race consistently.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 4. Buy Stock Ticker only when you have enough capital to make stocks relevant.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 5. Buy Bazaar only when your selling volume makes the unlock worthwhile.
