\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 1. Keep travel, trading, or war income flowing.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 2. Put spare capital into short bank investments.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 3. Reinvest repeatedly.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 4. Work toward the bank investment cap.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 5. Once capped, use longer terms if they fit your playstyle.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 6. Add stock benefit blocks only after understanding cost, liquidity, and ROI.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 7. Delay luxury purchases until income supports them.
