\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 MEDICAL ITEMS AND HOSPITAL RECOVERY
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 
Medical items reduce hospital time and/or restore life, but most add medical cooldown. If medical cooldown is too high, you cannot keep using normal medical items until the timer falls below your usable limit.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Beginner medical rules:
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Keep basic meds available before attacking, traveling with value, or joining war.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Do not burn expensive meds to force bad attacks. Train more or choose safer targets.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Morphine is common for reducing hospital time, but it still adds medical cooldown.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Blood bags become more relevant after Biology / Medical unlocks and proper setup.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Revives can remove hospital time even when medical cooldown would block more med use, but revives usually cost money, faction resources, or social\hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  goodwill.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Turn revive settings on/off deliberately in Preferences depending on whether you want outside revives.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Use meds to recover from worthwhile activity, not to repeatedly force losing fights.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 COOLDOWN BASICS
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Torn uses separate cooldown systems. Do not confuse them.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Medical cooldown:
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Added by most medical items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Base maximum is 6 hours before you are blocked from using more normal medical items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Faction perks can increase the maximum.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Booster cooldown:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Added by candy, alcohol, energy drinks, eDVDs, FHCs, and similar booster items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Base maximum is 24 hours before you are blocked from using more booster items.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Faction Voracity can increase this limit.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Drug cooldown:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Added by drugs such as Xanax, Cannabis, Ecstasy, LSD, Vicodin, Opium, and others.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Prevents taking another drug until it clears.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Drugs can also cause addiction and overdose.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Beginner examples:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Candy uses booster cooldown, not drug cooldown.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Ecstasy uses drug cooldown and overdose risk, not booster cooldown.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Morphine uses medical cooldown.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Opium is a drug that removes standard hospital time but uses drug cooldown and adds addiction.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Xanax gives energy but creates drug cooldown, addiction, overdose risk, and temporary combat penalties.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid13593964 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs28 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs24\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Before a war, happy jump, travel route, or mission chain, check all three cooldowns.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs32\insrsid11282807\charrsid13593964 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 8 - Gym Training, Happy Jumps, Xanax, and Beginner Training Rules
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 CORE RULE
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 
Energy is one of the most valuable beginner resources. After the level 15 rush, most energy should go into gym training unless faction war, missions, or a specific plan says otherwise.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Beginner priority:
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 1. Do not let natural energy sit capped.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 2. Rent the best happiness property you can reasonably afford.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 3. Unlock better gyms as soon as practical.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 4. Train consistently before chasing expensive optimization.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 5. Use Xanax and happy jumps only when you understand cooldown, addiction, overdose, and budget risk.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 For formulas, happiness depreciation, and phase-by-phase training plans, see Appendices A and B.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 WHAT AFFECTS GYM GAINS
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 The beginner version:
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Current stat matters \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  bigger stats gain more per train.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Energy matters \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  more energy trained means more gain.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Better gyms matter \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  gym dots multiply gains.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Happiness matters most at low stats and gradually becomes less dominant.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Direct gym-gain modifiers matter long term: Steadfast, Sports Science, property pool, some company specials, and some books.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 
Do not confuse raw gym gains with combat-only bonuses. Battle stat merits, passive education battle-stat bonuses, weapon effects, and faction passive combat bonuses can make you fight better, but they are not the same as increasing raw gym train size unle
\hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 ss they explicitly say they improve gym gains.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 GYM UNLOCKS
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 
Unlock better gyms as soon as practical. Membership fees are usually minor compared with long-term gains. Check whether the gym trains the stat you plan to use.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 
Specialist gyms can outperform balanced gyms when your stat ratio and access requirements support them. Do not wreck your account balance just to force access, but do consider gym access when planning long-term stat direction.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 HAPPINESS TIMING
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Happiness strongly improves gym gains at low stats, but timing matters.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Happy regenerates to your base max.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Above-base happy resets down every 15 minutes at xx:00, xx:15, xx:30, and xx:45.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Each gym train removes a portion of happiness.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Use boosters just after a reset, then train immediately.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  If base happy is filling slowly, cheap chocolates/candy can top it up before training.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Beginner interpretation:
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Low stats \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  happiness is extremely strong.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Mid stats \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  balance happiness against Xanax and refill consistency.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Higher stats \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  energy throughput, gym quality, Steadfast, education, and books matter more than expensive happy spikes.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 LOW-BUDGET CHOCO JUMP}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid4655594\charrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 1. Reach full natural energy.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 2. Wait until just after a happy reset.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 3. Use candy until booster cooldown is full or budget is spent.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 4. Use Ecstasy only if accepting overdose risk.
\par \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 5. Train immediately.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid4655594 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 2}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid4655594 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 -XANAX MINI JUMP
