\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Class E \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  use stock cars, spend 0 RP, save for Class D.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Class D \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  build one efficient D car, spend lightly, save most RP.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Class C \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  build one reliable C car, save for B.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Class B \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  build one useful B car, save for A.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Class A \hich\f44 \emdash \loch\f44  start with one strong general-purpose A setup, then build a fleet over time.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807 
