\af44\afs32 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\fs28\insrsid11282807\charrsid16613061 \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44 Tools are useful, but they are not required to play well. Start with a small stack, learn what each tool does, and avoid installing every script at once.

