\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807\charrsid14707570 \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Do not install random code from private messages.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Prefer scripts with public source, active forum threads, recent updates, and community feedback.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Read what API key access the script requests.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Avoid scripts that automate gameplay while you are absent, spam actions, or appear to violate Torn rules.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  Remove old scripts you no longer use.
\par \bullet \hich\af44\dbch\af31505\loch\f44  If a script breaks after a Torn update, disable it before assuming Torn itself is broken.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af44 \ltrch\fcs0 \f44\insrsid11282807 
